  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet hits you square on the chin, shattering bone and teeth before tearing through the base of your tongue and floor of the mouth, finally lodging at the back of your throat. Your shattered lower jaw is left dangling and bleeding.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3) and @Condition[Bleeding] (1). You also suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.hCadFsTRvLN9faaY]{Broken Bone (Major)} and lose your tongue and 1d10 teeth – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.fBcZhOBn8IpoVqQ1]{Amputation (Challenging)}. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Difficult)</strong> is required for Extraction.</p>"
    },
